<p>These are my suggestions to meeting participants in general and
architects and senior developers in particular:</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://signalvnoise.com/posts/3124-give-it-five-minutes">Give your colleague's idea 5
  minutes</a>. It
  could very well be the ide has merits you don't see. Letting the
  idea float for a couple of minutes before you shoot it down does not
  mean you endorse it.</li>
<li>Appreciate that there are no perfect solutions, all approaches come
  with their own set of advantages and disadvantages. Thus, make the
  meeting a safe place where people can share their ideas and voice
  their thoughts.</li>
<li>Don't interrupt</li>
<li>Don't laugh at your colleague's arguments.</li>
</ul>